# Agent skills, installed per-machine via `npx skills add`.
# Not vendored: they are third-party, they change upstream, and this repo's own
# docs/ take precedence over them wherever the two disagree.
# Exception: .claude/skills/pholio-site-language/ is first-party and versioned
# (this repo's own language system; its shared layer syncs with pholio-app).
.agents/
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/pholio-site-language/
skills-lock.json

